<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina says set $6.15 bln reverse repos Thurs.</title>
<headline>Argentina says set $6.15 bln reverse repos Thurs.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Friday it set $6.15 billion in overnight reverse repurchase agreements June 26.</p>
<p>The reverse repos were set at 5.0 percent against government bonds.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
